            "description": "<p>Bank stocks <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/wells-fargo-having-identity-crisis-143428124.html\">Wells Fargo</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WFC\">WFC</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/citi-earnings-beat-strength-cost-145708907.html\">Citigroup</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/C\">C</a>), and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/bank-america-earnings-regulatory-optimism-142127963.html\">Bank of America </a>(<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BAC\">BAC</a>) are selling off on Wednesday after the companies released their <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/bank-of-america-wells-fargo-report-profit-surge-as-trading-activity-powers-results-122621482.html\">fourth quarter earnings results</a>. JPMorgan Chase stock (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JPM\">JPM</a>) continues to slide since <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/jpmorgan-earnings-miss-forecasts-on-apple-card-costs-dimon-warns-markets-underappreciate-risks-122306831.html\">reporting its earnings </a>on Tuesday.</p>\n<p>Whalen Global Advisors Chairman Chris Whalen sits down with Market Catalysts Host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> to examine what may be causing these declines in bank stocks.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Bank stocks Wells Fargo (WFC), Citigroup (C), and Bank of America (BAC) are selling off on Wednesday after the companies released their fourth quarter earnings results. JPMorgan Chase stock (JPM) continues to slide since reporting its earnings on Tuesday. Whalen Global Advisors Chairman Chris Whalen sits down with Market Catalysts Host Julie Hyman to examine what may be causing these declines in bank stocks. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Catalysts.",
